    "turn_text": "when you first got elected in that first election, did you feel like you had to compromise your values to support President Trump? And, you know, does the issue go broader and deeper than just loyalty to the former president? It sounds like there were a lot of, a lot of issues, social and conservative issues that drove a lot of opposition in your own individuals.",
