    "turn_text": "I don't think Kevin is so stupid to think any of this, you know, stop the steel election. He stuff is really true or something we should run on as far as from a moral equivalent. But I say it's a political calculation. Kevin sees the numbers every day. And I've, and I've been trying to tell people this, you know, to win an election. And I remember You know, going into office, they said, you know, winners make history and it's only about winning. That's it. Doesn't matter about anything else. You have to win. That is the, I would say that is the ethos, right, of what's happening inside the GOP conference. It's about winning and they're seeing the writing on the wall that 2022 with redistricting the fact that election integrity is polling so well, and then they saw the first quarter fundraising numbers right Josh they saw that the D-trip raised 34.1 million and they raised almost 34 million it was a wash and so they're saying hey wait a minute this this message is working And then when you see Marjorie Taylor, green raised 3.2 million, what are gates raised? 1.8 million, Josh,",
