    "turn_idx": 52,
    "turn_text": "Uh, you know, probably not at this point. It would take, you know, I had a crazy idea before, but I, I'm still very interested in running for governor and I think a lot of people have asked, hey, Dan, we know that as an independent with your name ID, what you've done, you'd probably be the best independent candidate in Virginia, maybe in our history, you know, to start as an independent run that way. But I am looking at 2025 pretty hard. The thing is, Josh, you've seen me a lot. I am not a happy guy in politics. I'd almost rather go every day and get a tooth extracted without anesthesia than run for office again. But on the other hand, I think that people that hate politics have a duty to serve. And I think if you love your country and you really hate something, you still should probably give it a try. And I think maybe I'm going to give it another try again. I just don't know if it's going to be 21.",
