    "turn_idx": 67,
    "turn_text": "Exactly. And that is the issues. I'm telling you, people are not nuts. They might have to go to a tribe, but they're still the 50 to 60% in the middle who they're not crazy. They go to work every day. They might be center left or center right, but they're not nuts. So you might have, I will say this, I think 22 is going to be one of the most brutal midterm elections in the history of the United States when it comes to ideological screaming. And I think that the Democrats are not prepared. uh, that the GOP is in the same swim lane. I just don't think they get it. I, and you know, I see there's a lot of, again, people I respect on both sides of this who say, Hey, the Republican party has to crash. Maybe it does, but right now crazy is an amazing fuel. And so is hate, but you also have another fuel that people need to actually take into consideration. And that's crappy policies. So if the devs' policies are so out there that even people who think QAnon people should be committed, they're going to say, listen, I'll take that crazy over that crazy, the Dems are in trouble. I'm telling you, I think there could be a 20 to 40 seat swing. You know, again, with redistricting and what's going on here, the Republicans are mobilized. They're ready to go to war. Their fundraising apparatus is in place. Trump is going to continue to help them with fundraising. Who knows if he's going to run in 2024? Who knows if his health is going to hold up? But he's about to do a rally, Josh. He's doing another rally. And so again, what I'm saying is that if the Democrats want to be competitive, You know, don't be crazy. You know, don't try to match the crazy. You know, try to do something where you're reaching across the Republicans that are more fiscally conservative, right? And maybe don't want to listen to that if you're a Republican, you're evil, you're a Nazi. And that's the same kind of dehumanizing language I've been warning against. that the right is doing to the left. And so again, it's funny to see the reactions. Instead of coming to sanity as trying to match crazy is not a good thing to do. That is, tell you, when you get crazy on crazy violence, you do not want to be in the middle of that. I've been a bouncer for a long time. I was a bouncer. You do not want to be in the middle of crazy on crazy. Trust me.",
